      "mr_id": "subchannel-friction-invariance",
      "sut_name": "subchannel-1d",
      "display_name": "1D subchannel — ScaleFriction (ΔT invariant under f)",
      "description": "Decoupling invariance MP_inv: in this lumped 0D-axial energy balance the friction factor f only enters the momentum equation (Δp = f·L·G²/(2·ρ·D_h)). It does NOT appear in the energy balance ΔT = q''·P_h·L/(G·A_xs·c_p). Doubling f must therefore leave delta_T bit-identical (analytical closed-form invariance — no FD truncation involved).",
